      "originalPageVisualReview": true,
      "bilingualVerification": true,
      "finding": "距离为1/√Σu_i²=1/长度(U)，无倒数或根号归属错误。"
    },
    {
      "number": 15,
      "section": "3.3.4",
      "sampleStartLine": 32,
      "sampleEndLine": 34,
      "tex": "u_1+au_2+\\cdots+a^{t-1}u_t\\equiv0\\quad(\\text{modulo }m).\\tag{15}",
      "texSha256": "b4604cecd379fce674c469c698906f037ffafeb6298e7e47d69128f309622da1",
      "cnPdfPage": 85,
      "cnPrintedPage": 74,
      "enPdfPage": 113,
      "enPrintedPage": 98,
      "originalPageVisualReview": true,
      "bilingualVerification": true,
      "finding": "u_1+a u_2+…+a^(t−1)u_t≡0，模数m；现已保留原页modulo。"
    },
    {
      "number": 16,
      "section": "3.3.4",
      "sampleStartLine": 38,
      "sampleEndLine": 46,
      "tex": "\\begin{aligned}\n\\nu_t^2\n&=\\min_{(u_1,\\ldots,u_t)\\ne(0,\\ldots,0)}\n\\left\\{u_1^2+\\cdots+u_t^2\\;\\middle|\\;u_1+au_2+\\cdots+a^{t-1}u_t\\equiv0\\quad(\\text{modulo }m)\\right\\}\\\\\n&=\\min_{(x_1,\\ldots,x_t)\\ne(0,\\ldots,0)}\n\\left((mx_1-ax_2-a^2x_3-\\cdots-a^{t-1}x_t)^2+x_2^2+x_3^2+\\cdots+x_t^2\\right).\n\\end{aligned}\\tag{16}",
      "texSha256": "3fdcc9cb801ed151c52476986f483c1a8d64e172914c82d93f370c122201d88a",
      "cnPdfPage": 85,
      "cnPrintedPage": 74,
      "enPdfPage": 113,
      "enPrintedPage": 98,
      "originalPageVisualReview": true,
      "bilingualVerification": true,
      "finding": "第一行域为(u_1,…,u_t)≠0，目标Σu_i²且满足式15；第二行域为(x_1,…,x_t)≠0，首平方为(mx_1−a x_2−a²x_3−…−a^(t−1)x_t)²，再加x_2²+x_3²+…+x_t²。首项正、其余负，幂次1至t−1，两行都只排除全零。域、第一平方的两端、展开项及式号均与中英文原页核对。"
    },
    {
      "number": 17,
      "section": "3.3.4",
      "sampleStartLine": 52,
      "sampleEndLine": 54,
      "tex": "f(x_1,\\ldots,x_t)=(u_{11}x_1+\\cdots+u_{t1}x_t)^2+\\cdots+(u_{1t}x_1+\\cdots+u_{tt}x_t)^2\\tag{17}",
      "texSha256": "f926335ec5c8afbce3a4df47daaa3cacd5fcf05d5e148d19e47c65fc24c39231",
      "cnPdfPage": 85,
      "cnPrintedPage": 74,
      "enPdfPage": 113,
      "enPrintedPage": 98,
      "originalPageVisualReview": true,
      "bilingualVerification": true,
      "finding": "第一平方是u_{11}x_1+…+u_{t1}x_t；末平方是u_{1t}x_1+…+u_{tt}x_t。下标第一位随行变化、第二位固定于相应列；未误转置，与U_i为行一致。"
    },
    {
      "number": 18,
      "section": "3.3.4",
      "sampleStartLine": 60,
      "sampleEndLine": 62,
      "tex": "f(x_1,\\ldots,x_t)=(x_1U_1+\\cdots+x_tU_t)\\cdot(x_1U_1+\\cdots+x_tU_t).\\tag{18}",
      "texSha256": "a79476350569b1a54bd7746470e98fa039c72ea9208bfd28eea359042b39bba7",
      "cnPdfPage": 85,
      "cnPrintedPage": 74,
      "enPdfPage": 113,
      "enPrintedPage": 98,
      "originalPageVisualReview": true,
      "bilingualVerification": true,
      "finding": "同一向量x_1U_1+…+x_tU_t与自身点乘，等于其长度平方，左右两因子的项和下标一致。"
    }
